TETHERKIT_MESSAGE(kCapiDhcpTimeout,
                  "DHCP 在 {} 秒内没有拿到租约。\n"
                  "  常见原因：设备侧没有开启网络共享，或对端没有 DHCP 服务器。\n"
                  "  服务仍在后台重试，稍后刷新可能会看到地址；也可以改用静态 IP。",
                  "DHCP did not obtain a lease within {} seconds.\n"
                  "  Common causes: tethering is not enabled on the device, or the peer runs no "
                  "DHCP server.\n"
                  "  The service keeps retrying in the background, so an address may still appear "
                  "if you refresh later; you can also switch to a static IP.")
TETHERKIT_MESSAGE(kCapiDhcpNoRouter,
                  "已拿到 DHCP 租约，但租约里没有网关地址，无法把全局默认路由指向它。",
                  "got a DHCP lease, but it carries no router address, so the global default route "
                  "cannot be pointed at it.")
